WEBVTT

00:01.391 --> 00:03.591
I don't regret being born in this life
to meet you guys!

00:04.867 --> 00:06.087
 Brothers for life!

00:06.112 --> 00:08.338
 - Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:08.394 --> 00:09.461
 Why did you come here?

00:09.486 --> 00:10.448
 To make money.

00:10.473 --> 00:11.408
 His father has kidney disease.

00:11.433 --> 00:13.716
 For me, I'm making money
to marry Ut Det.

00:13.725 --> 00:16.441
 His mom has a gambling addiction.

00:16.557 --> 00:17.889
 What are you going to do
when you come home?

00:17.913 --> 00:19.154
 But I can't leave my mom there!

00:19.631 --> 00:21.117
 We want to join the Chinatown gang.

00:22.016 --> 00:24.122
 All but two things can be traded here:

00:24.240 --> 00:26.199
 Except humans and drugs.

00:42.766 --> 00:44.791
Don't touch my bros.

00:48.193 --> 00:50.097
Why didn't you
let your juniors take them down?

00:50.122 --> 00:51.474
He's in the dark,

00:51.499 --> 00:52.725
and you're in the light now.

00:52.750 --> 00:53.772
Are you scared?

00:53.862 --> 00:55.739
If you're scared,
then I'm gonna finish them off myself!

00:55.763 --> 00:57.012
It's the Chinatown gang!

00:57.037 --> 00:58.612
The North Port gang can't wait any longer!

00:58.636 --> 01:01.221
How dare they touch Big Brother's area?

01:01.246 --> 01:02.325
As you know,

01:02.350 --> 01:04.864
they played dirty with
Big Brother over and over.

01:04.889 --> 01:07.606
We can't keep standing by to watch.

01:07.815 --> 01:10.248
We must show them who we are!

01:13.515 --> 01:15.016
Gangster is a one-way road.

01:15.784 --> 01:17.558
Once you've entered,

01:17.936 --> 01:19.079
you can only go straight forward.

01:19.232 --> 01:20.506
There's no turning back.

01:36.058 --> 01:37.918
Chan was used as bait.

01:38.536 --> 01:39.536
But...

01:39.561 --> 01:40.752
his death...

01:40.777 --> 01:42.104
was unexpected

01:42.129 --> 01:44.106
I want you
to travel to the North.

01:45.913 --> 01:47.049
This evening,

01:47.074 --> 01:48.394
let's break into Chinatown...

01:48.419 --> 01:50.362
and kill them all.

01:54.565 --> 01:55.386
Hanh!

01:55.411 --> 01:56.453
You messed with me,

01:56.478 --> 01:57.924
I'll mess with your bitch.

01:57.949 --> 02:01.122
Find me in The North Port
if you want your bitch back.

02:01.147 --> 02:02.147
Son of a bitch!

02:02.228 --> 02:03.228
We're...

02:03.270 --> 02:04.704
traveling there
to take revenge for Hanh.

02:04.728 --> 02:05.996
We don't even know
whether we would be able to survive.

02:06.020 --> 02:08.303
Who will take care of Ut Det
when you're gone?

02:08.437 --> 02:09.405
Her mom will.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.430
I'll follow you.

02:10.687 --> 02:11.421
For what?

02:11.520 --> 02:12.743
To take care of you.

02:14.007 --> 02:15.825
Have you heard anything about Hung?

02:16.574 --> 02:18.874
He is nothing more than
a rabid dog under Ky's command.

02:19.055 --> 02:21.458
He bites anyone
Ky commands him to.

02:21.483 --> 02:23.115
What if I want to meet Ky?

02:24.069 --> 02:26.201
Why didn't you
inform me that you came here?

02:26.226 --> 02:28.322
Bring Hac Hung to me,

02:28.347 --> 02:30.162
and I will let it slide.

02:40.210 --> 02:41.210
Nobody move!

02:42.460 --> 02:43.899
This place is not Chinatown.

02:43.965 --> 02:45.890
This fight is not yours to take.

02:58.335 --> 03:00.172
The blood debt
must be paid with blood.

03:00.879 --> 03:01.879
Phong!

03:08.288 --> 03:09.679
I must kill him...

03:09.704 --> 03:11.167
to take revenge for Ba!

03:27.615 --> 03:31.486
Roaming the street's end
and lane's edge, yet never yielding.

03:31.669 --> 03:35.236
Peddling dope and drugs,
yet always brotherhood shielding.

03:36.448 --> 03:38.104
After the turmoil

03:39.633 --> 03:40.718
of killings...

03:41.210 --> 03:42.210
bloodbaths...

03:42.235 --> 03:43.537
loss...

03:43.924 --> 03:45.236
and pain.

03:45.261 --> 03:47.987
That's the price they have to pay
once you get involved.

03:48.690 --> 03:49.290
Ba...

03:49.331 --> 03:50.382
In order to protect his friends,

03:50.406 --> 03:52.531
Ba gave his life in the battle
at The North Port.

03:53.698 --> 03:57.181
Hai Cuong ended up in jail,
facing the consequences of his actions.

03:57.206 --> 03:59.309
Using his abilities,

03:59.334 --> 04:02.117
Hao has led Chinatown
to function more expertly each day.

04:02.142 --> 04:04.684
He has created
multiple flourishing front businesses.

04:04.709 --> 04:07.797
Long and Phong
have become his powerful right-hand men.

04:08.999 --> 04:11.321
The security situation
is more unstable than ever.

04:11.346 --> 04:16.009
Hung's leadership in the battle against
crime has intensified at this phase.

04:16.101 --> 04:20.497
That action has had a direct impact
on the benefits of a covert group,

04:20.804 --> 04:23.029
forcing them to
free the tiger back into the woods.

04:23.054 --> 04:24.787
They are considered to be the Council,

04:24.812 --> 04:27.163
a group that
manipulates the underworld's hierarchy.

04:27.922 --> 04:28.880
Chinatown...

04:28.905 --> 04:30.718
is more unstable than ever.

04:43.437 --> 04:47.741
BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3

04:47.801 --> 04:49.257
[Episode 2: Chinatown unrest]

04:49.282 --> 04:50.520
Miss Huong...

04:50.996 --> 04:52.527
500 thousands.

04:52.967 --> 04:53.996
Who's next?

04:54.579 --> 04:56.013
Mr. Cuong Bay (Seven)!

04:56.038 --> 04:57.172
Cuong Bay (Seven)

04:57.288 --> 04:57.935
How much?

04:57.960 --> 04:59.776
200 thousands.

05:02.402 --> 05:04.775
Cuong Seven... 200 thousands.

05:05.416 --> 05:06.650
Yes.

05:07.302 --> 05:08.586
It will be all right.

05:08.611 --> 05:10.888
Look!
Mr. Phong gift is really big.

05:10.913 --> 05:11.871
Who?

05:11.913 --> 05:13.787
Mr. Phong.
Mr. Phong gift is really big.

05:13.788 --> 05:17.237
He is doing way too much
for his best friend.

05:18.699 --> 05:20.471
Give me, give me!
Hands it all to me!

05:20.496 --> 05:22.514
That is your "best" friend right there!

05:22.587 --> 05:24.593
I will deal with him tomorrow,
once and for all.

05:24.985 --> 05:26.832
He hasn't given me back
the money I lent him.

05:27.579 --> 05:28.579
Yeah...

05:30.746 --> 05:31.304
Darling!

05:31.329 --> 05:32.329
Hmm...?

05:33.485 --> 05:34.797
Go and ready the bed.

05:38.538 --> 05:39.864
Okay!

05:40.367 --> 05:42.205
But you better be quick...

05:42.246 --> 05:43.771
Of course, I will be there.

05:46.891 --> 05:48.384
Hurry!

05:48.626 --> 05:49.941
I got it!

06:08.976 --> 06:09.976
Boss!

06:11.079 --> 06:12.079
Boss!

06:12.788 --> 06:13.986
Wake up, Boss!

06:14.011 --> 06:15.011
Boss!

06:17.288 --> 06:18.288
Wake up!

06:19.204 --> 06:20.454
Wake up.

06:20.829 --> 06:22.557
Boss!
You have a phone call...

06:23.320 --> 06:24.320
Boss!

06:26.194 --> 06:27.327
Hello?

06:28.579 --> 06:29.579
What?

06:29.913 --> 06:31.085
Say again.

06:44.391 --> 06:45.619
I am listening...

06:46.570 --> 06:47.570
What?

06:51.594 --> 06:52.388
Please drink it.

06:52.413 --> 06:53.569
What is this, mother?

06:53.594 --> 06:55.554
This medicine originated from my hometown.

06:55.579 --> 06:58.162
It was truly difficult to got my hand.

06:58.187 --> 06:59.508
Just drink it!

07:04.746 --> 07:05.919
Just drink it!

07:08.514 --> 07:11.030
Drink it so I can have a
grandchild to hold onto.

08:13.329 --> 08:14.329
Go.

08:18.420 --> 08:20.133
- Slay them all!
- Drop the weapons down!

08:20.158 --> 08:21.031
Police!

08:21.056 --> 08:22.449
Freeze!

08:32.526 --> 08:33.765
Book them all!

08:39.663 --> 08:40.865
You guys are too rough!

08:41.120 --> 08:42.703
Rough?
What is rough?

08:42.728 --> 08:43.894
You and me?

08:43.919 --> 08:45.740
This is how we brothers supposed to roll!

08:46.930 --> 08:48.096
Hung, I own you a gratitude.

08:48.412 --> 08:50.307
What is the situation with Brother Hao?

08:50.332 --> 08:51.332
He is fine.

08:51.921 --> 08:53.700
How come you never
arrested those attackers?

08:54.477 --> 08:55.624
None of your business.

08:59.996 --> 09:02.579
I thinks I missed it up, Long.

09:02.746 --> 09:03.388
What?

09:03.413 --> 09:04.413
Look!

09:08.571 --> 09:09.571
Oh dear...

09:10.303 --> 09:12.597
Once you get home,
hug your mom real tight.

09:12.622 --> 09:14.734
Because you won't survive
an incoming Hell-wrath.

09:14.829 --> 09:15.554
Whose "mom"?

09:15.579 --> 09:16.642
The Big Momma.

09:19.710 --> 09:20.883
What should I do?

09:21.243 --> 09:22.243
Out!

09:22.702 --> 09:23.304
Alone?

09:23.329 --> 09:24.394
Yes!

09:24.811 --> 09:25.346
Please don't...

09:25.371 --> 09:26.315
Quick!

09:28.157 --> 09:29.809
You cannot escaped this one, Long.

09:33.329 --> 09:34.329
Godspeed!

09:37.477 --> 09:39.140
Take care of yourself, Long!

09:41.416 --> 09:42.721
Where to go, Comrade?

09:42.746 --> 09:43.335
Back to police station.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.053
Huh?

09:44.292 --> 09:45.387
To the Police Central!

09:46.121 --> 09:47.495
Roger that!

09:56.663 --> 09:58.545
Dung!

10:00.709 --> 10:01.600
Dung!

10:01.952 --> 10:03.097
Baby, please!
I am really sorry!

10:03.121 --> 10:04.121
Dung!

10:09.975 --> 10:10.975
Dung!

10:20.454 --> 10:22.928
Why is our boss placed in
such the tiniest room ever?

10:23.061 --> 10:24.145
Please forgive us.

10:24.170 --> 10:25.490
The hospital is at full capacity.

10:41.305 --> 10:42.744
What do you guys thinks?

10:43.008 --> 10:46.057
I myself cannot afford to
pay for 2 protection at all!

10:46.329 --> 10:48.554
Just go with the flow.

10:48.672 --> 10:51.245
Why should you bother with minor things?

10:51.270 --> 10:53.593
Do not play with edged tools.

10:53.858 --> 10:55.772
I would rather making
little money on the side

10:55.797 --> 10:58.506
rather than breaking
the Strict Codex at all.

10:58.813 --> 11:02.014
Even men like Hao got destroyed.

11:02.039 --> 11:04.058
You twos can sort it out yourself.

11:08.163 --> 11:09.264
Bitch!

11:09.913 --> 11:11.085
Please forgive me!

11:11.464 --> 11:12.464
Drink it!

11:12.996 --> 11:14.224
Drink a lot!

11:14.351 --> 11:15.545
Let me go!

11:19.538 --> 11:20.538
You okay there?

11:20.563 --> 11:22.057
Should I call Brother Long
for reinforcement?

11:29.604 --> 11:30.682
Let me go!

11:37.701 --> 11:39.388
This is not a brothel.

11:39.579 --> 11:40.579
Get out!

11:52.412 --> 11:53.630
What are you laughing at?

12:18.663 --> 12:19.462
Stop here!

12:19.487 --> 12:21.970
This is a crime scene!
Nobody allowed in!

12:26.039 --> 12:27.308
What are you guys doing here?

12:27.680 --> 12:28.680
Go home!

12:32.229 --> 12:34.753
[District 8 Hospital]

12:45.670 --> 12:46.721
Excuse me...

12:46.746 --> 12:48.312
Can you...

12:48.358 --> 12:49.643
Actually... never mind.

12:55.647 --> 12:56.647
Brother Hao.

12:57.275 --> 12:58.514
Thanks you for the hard work.

12:58.538 --> 12:59.096
Brother Hao...

12:59.121 --> 12:59.621
Hey!

12:59.646 --> 13:00.138
Yes?

13:00.163 --> 13:01.509
Go take a dump.

13:01.829 --> 13:03.204
Ah... I got hemorrhoids...

13:03.496 --> 13:04.205
Quickly!

13:04.230 --> 13:06.062
I... I... I...
I will hit the toilet now.

13:14.777 --> 13:16.452
Dammit...

13:18.235 --> 13:20.029
Luckily, you were drunk at that time.

13:21.019 --> 13:22.513
You dare pity me?

13:24.212 --> 13:25.593
You talk too much.

13:25.954 --> 13:28.613
Now, go and find out where their lair is.

13:28.717 --> 13:30.094
And report back to me

13:30.182 --> 13:32.430
but absolutely, in no circumstancs,
bring along any mens.

13:32.454 --> 13:33.154
Hey!

13:33.179 --> 13:34.780
I hits where I want it to be.
Unlike you...

13:34.829 --> 13:35.646
Shut...

13:35.671 --> 13:36.954
Why the stiff up?

13:37.506 --> 13:38.905
I will call you later.

13:43.932 --> 13:44.638
Hey!

13:44.663 --> 13:45.505
Yes?

13:45.713 --> 13:47.121
Ah... uhm...
I just finished peeing...

13:47.121 --> 13:47.885
Out!

13:47.932 --> 13:49.334
I mean...
I need to pee again...

13:49.359 --> 13:50.420
[Warning]

14:08.079 --> 14:08.943
Yes sir?

14:09.613 --> 14:10.845
Chinatown...

14:11.722 --> 14:14.480
I am counting on you.

14:20.121 --> 14:21.596
Take it easy, Brother Hao.

14:21.993 --> 14:23.440
Let me take care of everything.

14:32.704 --> 14:33.704
Hai Cuong!

14:33.729 --> 14:35.065
You have a visitor.

14:44.430 --> 14:45.430
Big Brother!

14:54.579 --> 14:55.579
Where is Hao?

15:04.871 --> 15:06.525
Something happened at Chinatown?

15:08.621 --> 15:10.224
Brother Hao is in the hospital.

15:13.008 --> 15:14.613
Is he still alive?

15:15.761 --> 15:16.761
Yes sir.

15:20.761 --> 15:22.392
To be alive is a blessing.

15:24.680 --> 15:26.502
Chinatown is in dire need of a leader.

15:27.608 --> 15:29.233
Brother Hao told me...

15:30.094 --> 15:31.857
to ask you for an advice.

15:33.074 --> 15:35.939
Who needs my advice?
You or him?

15:45.762 --> 15:47.429
When will the slaughter end.

15:51.746 --> 15:54.221
I heard you just got married.

15:56.269 --> 15:58.010
A married man,

15:59.492 --> 16:02.162
must be very careful in his thoughts.

16:03.842 --> 16:05.501
Avoid uncessary things.

16:05.526 --> 16:06.526
But...

16:12.516 --> 16:14.616
But this can't be avoided, Big brother.

16:14.912 --> 16:17.049
They tried every way to kill Mr.Hao.

16:17.235 --> 16:18.840
Then you have to be strong

16:19.349 --> 16:21.182
in order to protect Hao.

16:22.297 --> 16:23.889
I am trying my best

16:24.165 --> 16:25.679
even if it cost my life...

16:25.704 --> 16:27.672
- I will gladly...
- Don't be thinking about it!

16:29.363 --> 16:31.061
Don't just casually says...

16:31.086 --> 16:32.611
"willing to die."

16:33.954 --> 16:35.407
Nothing good comes out of it.

16:35.626 --> 16:38.159
Not everybody is born a hero.

16:39.128 --> 16:40.776
It takes times...

16:41.077 --> 16:42.701
to create one.

16:44.569 --> 16:46.610
You have to be stronger...

16:47.968 --> 16:50.510
in order to protect your family.

16:52.238 --> 16:53.229
Damm!

16:53.254 --> 16:55.008
Is Big Brother in jail or in Temple?

16:55.199 --> 16:56.600
Wait, did he really meaning it?

16:56.865 --> 16:58.168
If you telling the truth,

16:58.227 --> 17:00.368
he is giving you a clear signal
to get out of the game!

17:00.393 --> 17:02.429
Whatever you promise
to both your mother and wife,

17:02.454 --> 17:03.540
you will do so.

17:03.565 --> 17:04.685
Get out while you can, Long.

17:11.486 --> 17:14.064
 [Rest in peace]

17:19.480 --> 17:21.524
You have any informations
about this man Din?

17:22.813 --> 17:24.273
You two better stay out of it.

17:24.574 --> 17:25.574
Huh?

17:26.879 --> 17:27.879
What?

17:29.703 --> 17:32.182
Wait until everyone
is lying down before touching him?

17:33.188 --> 17:34.775
People also have families!

17:34.800 --> 17:36.228
Wife and Childrens!

17:36.579 --> 17:38.522
They need food too!

17:39.421 --> 17:42.610
If only you could think like what you said,
that would be great.

17:42.990 --> 17:44.261
Thinks about it...

17:45.163 --> 17:47.363
How do you feel
if each one of you saw ur own grave now?

17:48.144 --> 17:49.347
Do you feel happy?

17:52.383 --> 17:53.679
That's because...

17:54.268 --> 17:56.037
I want to make sure Brother Hao is alive

17:56.038 --> 17:57.678
while keeping the peace in Chinatown too.

17:57.703 --> 17:58.703
Are you that dense!

17:59.394 --> 18:00.812
That ain't your bussiness.

18:04.788 --> 18:06.463
It just that...

18:06.488 --> 18:08.589
I just don't want to
light any more incense for fellow brother.

18:08.614 --> 18:09.773
Dammit!

18:29.579 --> 18:31.169
Anyting to report, my daughter?

18:32.194 --> 18:34.078
Din is a very brutal person.

18:34.103 --> 18:36.288
Ready to kill regardless of the law.

18:37.790 --> 18:40.210
That is the choice of the Elders.

18:40.685 --> 18:42.564
We have to respect their decision.

18:43.493 --> 18:45.230
But Chinatown is at peace.

18:45.255 --> 18:47.076
Why did they release him like that?

18:49.097 --> 18:50.346
If water is too clear

18:50.371 --> 18:51.738
there will be no fish.

18:52.204 --> 18:53.554
No fish?

18:53.579 --> 18:54.928
No food to eat.

18:56.866 --> 18:57.596
I know...

18:57.621 --> 18:58.836
what you are thinking.

18:58.861 --> 19:00.395
But you cannot break the rules.

19:00.644 --> 19:02.652
You must draw a clear line
between public and private affairs.

19:04.788 --> 19:06.688
You are the eyes and ears of the Council.

19:07.761 --> 19:10.027
Don't do anything to embarrass me.

19:10.496 --> 19:11.496
Understand?

19:13.038 --> 19:14.038
Yes, father.

19:15.621 --> 19:17.449
Enjoy the show.

19:17.889 --> 19:19.836
When the curtain falls,

19:20.992 --> 19:22.609
I will the let you know.

19:25.038 --> 19:26.715
Chinatown is in dilemma

19:26.740 --> 19:28.020
yet we have to clean up garbage!

19:28.600 --> 19:30.582
We were meant for something bigger!

19:31.186 --> 19:32.244
Real talk, coming from you!

19:32.288 --> 19:33.870
One man, Din,
can take on a hundred.

19:33.871 --> 19:35.151
Can you take on him,
mano a mano?

19:35.176 --> 19:36.176
Sound scary...

19:36.201 --> 19:38.219
If he is is so intimidating,
who has a chance of defeating him?

19:38.244 --> 19:39.176
Hmm...

19:39.201 --> 19:40.201
How about Brother Long?

19:40.282 --> 19:41.570
Can he?

19:41.702 --> 19:43.941
He looks a little bit of a scaredy-cat.

19:44.230 --> 19:45.230
Do it, Long!

19:46.179 --> 19:47.392
Big Boss of Chinatown!

19:47.649 --> 19:49.399
Hundreds of minions stand behind you!

19:49.899 --> 19:50.899
Charge!

19:51.704 --> 19:52.912
Sound cool, eh?

19:53.621 --> 19:54.621
Fantastic!

19:54.980 --> 19:56.525
Cut it out, Phong...

19:59.066 --> 20:00.795
What's the matter with you?

20:01.406 --> 20:02.748
There is also Brother Phong too!

20:02.954 --> 20:03.663
Chinatown iconic duo!

20:03.663 --> 20:05.565
First Long, Second Phong!

20:06.704 --> 20:07.457
Exactly!

20:07.538 --> 20:08.096
Then...

20:08.121 --> 20:09.722
we shall call brother Long
as Big Brother first!

20:09.746 --> 20:10.764
That would make us less naive.

20:10.788 --> 20:12.373
Mr. Phong... is Third Brother!

20:12.398 --> 20:13.476
Then that makes me the Fourth Brother!

20:13.538 --> 20:14.341
Right!

20:14.454 --> 20:15.494
Then the Fifth will be me!

20:15.538 --> 20:16.431
As for you,
Little Brother it is.

20:16.456 --> 20:17.323
Huh?

20:17.348 --> 20:18.976
What about Mr.Hung?

20:19.709 --> 20:21.323
Let me explain this to you...

20:22.077 --> 20:24.070
Our current level is at "sharp" weapon.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.790
For him, "cannon" is where he is at.

20:27.441 --> 20:29.421
He is way above us now...

20:29.777 --> 20:31.616
Don't even bring him
into the topic anymore.

20:32.206 --> 20:33.204
Hey!

20:33.686 --> 20:35.000
What if right after this trip...

20:35.186 --> 20:36.640
All three of us got promoted!

20:38.246 --> 20:39.389
Dammit!

20:39.621 --> 20:40.584
I should...

20:40.609 --> 20:42.389
have join Brother Phong way earlier!

20:42.548 --> 20:45.001
Doing drugs only brings harm to myself.

20:46.324 --> 20:49.407
Smoking all days yet refuse to explore!

20:49.970 --> 20:51.554
Shut it, dogs!

20:55.288 --> 20:57.089
What with the majestic pose?

20:57.592 --> 20:58.592
Hey!

20:59.141 --> 21:00.615
If you don't do it then I will!

21:01.094 --> 21:03.072
What's there to think about?

21:04.081 --> 21:05.403
Go home to your wife.

21:08.788 --> 21:09.788
Ouch!

21:10.704 --> 21:12.155
Careful!

21:18.704 --> 21:19.744
Good morning, Big Brother!

21:20.829 --> 21:22.309
Make sure to work hard!

21:23.454 --> 21:24.493
Uhm, Boss?

21:24.855 --> 21:27.446
Why he's so serious?
Have you told him yet, bro?

21:27.704 --> 21:28.704
He is always like that!

21:29.517 --> 21:31.399
Okay... What with...

21:31.440 --> 21:32.589
the flashy clothes?

21:32.614 --> 21:33.221
Ah, this isn't flashy at all?

21:33.246 --> 21:34.639
We just trying our best to dress properly.

21:34.663 --> 21:35.680
We managed to save ones for you, Boss!

21:35.704 --> 21:36.714
Keep holding on to that.

21:37.358 --> 21:38.318
That's some clever thinking right there.

21:38.870 --> 21:39.888
We are your henchmens, after all.

21:39.913 --> 21:41.479
Have to prepare for anything!

21:43.204 --> 21:44.113
Hey...

21:44.245 --> 21:45.263
This house is hefty looks rich.

21:45.288 --> 21:46.036
Oy!

21:46.594 --> 21:48.936
Rich or poor,
it's all the same poop.

21:48.961 --> 21:49.961
Let's Go!

21:53.704 --> 21:54.888
eh...

21:54.913 --> 21:55.710
Nam!

21:55.746 --> 21:56.746
Stop with the horseplay!

21:56.788 --> 21:58.371
Grown man don't do that!

21:59.079 --> 22:00.079
Big Boss!

22:00.496 --> 22:01.680
Look at this fatty rat!
Only a rich house has them!

22:01.704 --> 22:02.484
Throw them out!

22:02.509 --> 22:03.929
Help me, help me!

22:03.954 --> 22:04.954
Tu.

22:05.079 --> 22:06.079
Stop playing around!

22:06.163 --> 22:07.013
He is still a "kid".

22:07.038 --> 22:08.597
If you keep scaring him like that,
he will be in shock!

22:08.621 --> 22:10.704
Spooky!!
Spook the heck out of you!!

22:10.746 --> 22:11.513
Oh my god!!

22:11.538 --> 22:13.329
You and your sense of humor!

22:15.621 --> 22:16.877
Can you hold onto the baby?

22:17.391 --> 22:19.275
Not now.
I have to do my live stream session.

22:21.647 --> 22:23.119
Hello everyone!

22:23.454 --> 22:24.805
Oh my god! Nice to see everyone again!

22:24.829 --> 22:27.456
Wow!
Today we are having a lot of special offer!

22:27.538 --> 22:29.840
Who the hell is calling me now?

22:33.432 --> 22:34.595
Here!

22:36.194 --> 22:39.304
Super bargain sale!

22:39.329 --> 22:40.639
Lowest prices at all time, ladies!

22:40.663 --> 22:41.383
I am telling you for real!

22:41.579 --> 22:41.996
Lowest discount every day!

22:42.038 --> 22:43.410
Super cheap!

22:53.761 --> 22:56.315
Oh damm!
I didn't know our boss is bold like that.

22:59.379 --> 23:01.079
It's not what you are thinking!

23:10.414 --> 23:12.630
The majority of territories...

23:12.655 --> 23:14.579
are controlled by Hao and Long.

23:14.604 --> 23:15.745
The killing spree?

23:15.746 --> 23:17.484
We pay no heed about it.

23:17.686 --> 23:19.098
If you succeed,

23:19.123 --> 23:20.515
then we will together be rich!

23:20.540 --> 23:21.914
It is just simply business.

23:21.939 --> 23:24.238
Nonsense violence only brings misfortune.

23:24.263 --> 23:27.734
The Scrict Codex forbidded
us from dealing drug.

23:28.266 --> 23:29.906
We rather make some hustle on the side...

23:29.931 --> 23:31.531
without being hanged.

23:31.844 --> 23:34.327
Apologies.
I have to sit this one out.

24:06.479 --> 24:07.263
Hey!

24:07.288 --> 24:08.330
Where do you think you going?

25:09.210 --> 25:10.468
I'm here, Brother Hao!

25:13.215 --> 25:14.215
Brother Hao?

26:01.829 --> 26:03.681
Officer! I am a relatives!
Please let me through!

26:03.746 --> 26:04.413
Denied!
Please steps away!

26:04.454 --> 26:05.662
My family is in there!

26:05.687 --> 26:06.980
I can't. Please step away.

26:41.311 --> 26:43.697
You have to stick out
your chest like that, Mom!

26:44.454 --> 26:45.454
Like that!

26:45.641 --> 26:47.507
Now, it is your turn now!

26:49.561 --> 26:51.530
- Taking it slowly.
- Yes.

26:52.704 --> 26:54.287
- That's right.
- Breath in.

26:54.871 --> 26:57.172
There you go!
Breath out.

26:57.972 --> 26:59.264
There you go!

26:59.289 --> 27:01.829
Ouch!
It is impossible!

27:01.854 --> 27:05.664
Nowadays, seniors are starting to do yoga,
so their bodies can be flexible.

27:05.689 --> 27:07.673
Thinks about your own grandchild as well!

27:07.711 --> 27:08.846
Oh really?

27:08.871 --> 27:09.849
A grandchild!

27:09.874 --> 27:10.965
I will try my best!

27:11.462 --> 27:12.846
Mom, I thinks Long is back!

27:12.871 --> 27:14.884
Go and open the door for him.

27:22.136 --> 27:23.593
Who are you looking for?

27:29.531 --> 27:30.822
 BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3
